import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 510 | Origin Acceleration Domain · Civilizational-Iteration Case Simulation in the Acceleration Domain","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 510 | Origin Acceleration Domain · Civilizational-Iteration Case Simulation in the Acceleration Domain","no":510,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Civilizational Iteration","Case Simulation","Deduction Review","Risk Contingency"],"related":["11-Deduction-Iteration System Details","89-Time-Paradox Prevention Mechanism","75-20%-Activation Strategy Implementation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0510_模块3-文明迭代案例模拟.md","filePath":"en/0510_模块3-文明迭代案例模拟.md"}'),n={name:"en/0510_模块3-文明迭代案例模拟.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,h){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-510-origin-acceleration-domain-·-civilizational-iteration-case-simulation-in-the-acceleration-domain" tabindex="-1">Entry 510 | Origin Acceleration Domain · Civilizational-Iteration Case Simulation in the Acceleration Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-510-origin-acceleration-domain-·-civilizational-iteration-case-simulation-in-the-acceleration-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 510 | Origin Acceleration Domain · Civilizational-Iteration Case Simulation in the Acceleration Domain&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 11, 89, 75</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-use-a-hundred-years-of-deduction-to-buy-a-plane-s-rebirth" tabindex="-1">Introduction: use a hundred years of deduction to buy a plane&#39;s rebirth <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-use-a-hundred-years-of-deduction-to-buy-a-plane-s-rebirth" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: use a hundred years of deduction to buy a plane&#39;s rebirth&quot;">​</a></h2><p>No matter how much theory, nothing beats a real engineering case. This entry takes a typical &quot;plane energy-upgrade&quot; deduction task as an example, showing how the Origin Acceleration Domain compresses a civilization-grade project that normally takes decades into a few reality months, all without touching predation, without polluting causality. Six top-level axioms run through this case throughout: develop increment not predatory stock; let that plane&#39;s Myriad Ranks share the upgrade dividend; strong ones do not ascend alone but lift the whole plane; operations filed throughout, only knowledge returned; all deduction parameters stable and recalculable. The sixth, the universal equal infinite law, establishes the origin logic that everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-case-background-a-low-energy-plane-s-energy-bottleneck" tabindex="-1">I. Case Background: A Low-Energy Plane&#39;s Energy Bottleneck <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-case-background-a-low-energy-plane-s-energy-bottleneck" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Case Background: A Low-Energy Plane&#39;s Energy Bottleneck&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Assume a carbon-based civilization plane (hereinafter Plane M) has developed to late industrial civilization; fossil energy depleted; new-energy technology long unable to break through; society begins to show internal division. If developing normally, Plane M may slide into long-term decline after two or three generations, even regressing into a predatory civilization. Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s task: without directly interfering with its internal politics, help it complete one energy iteration.</p><h2 id="ii-deduction-process-inside-the-acceleration-domain" tabindex="-1">II. Deduction Process Inside the Acceleration Domain <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-deduction-process-inside-the-acceleration-domain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Deduction Process Inside the Acceleration Domain&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Reality Duration</th><th>Inside-Acceleration-Domain Duration</th><th>Main Work</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Pure-observation phase</td><td>3 days</td><td>3 days (not accelerated)</td><td>Observe first per Document 83; map Plane M&#39;s energy structure</td></tr><tr><td>Model building</td><td>2 days</td><td>200 days</td><td>Use 100× gear to build digital model of Plane M&#39;s energy system</td></tr><tr><td>Scheme deduction</td><td>5 days</td><td>500 days</td><td>Parallel-deduce dozens of energy-upgrade routes</td></tr><tr><td>Risk filtering</td><td>2 days</td><td>200 days</td><td>Eliminate schemes likely to trigger social unrest or ecological collapse</td></tr><tr><td>Optimal selection</td><td>1 day</td><td>100 days</td><td>Select 3 most-stable schemes; hand to Plane M for self-selection</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The whole project reality duration about 13 days; accumulated inside Acceleration Domain about 1000 days (nearly three years of consciousness time).</p><h2 id="iii-output-and-return" tabindex="-1">III. Output and Return <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-output-and-return" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Output and Return&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Acceleration Domain does not directly send people to Plane M to do reform. Its output is three <strong>validated technical solution packages</strong>:</p><ul><li>A low-cost solar + fusion hybrid scheme;</li><li>A medium-cost law-resonance miniaturization scheme;</li><li>A high-cost but long-term-optimal spatial-legal-scheduling scheme.</li></ul><p>Three schemes returned to Plane M as abstract knowledge after information purification; Plane M&#39;s own Myriad Ranks decide which to choose. Anchor Symbiotic Civilization only provides knowledge, does not choose for them — this is the embodiment of the Myriad-Ranks self-chosen-destiny mechanism (from Entry 525).</p><h2 id="iv-causal-self-check" tabindex="-1">IV. Causal Self-Check <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-causal-self-check" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Causal Self-Check&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After project completion, the Alaya Network does causal self-check on the whole process:</p><ul><li>Did it disturb Plane M&#39;s political direction? No; schemes only provide technology, do not designate a regime;</li><li>Did it bring back Plane M&#39;s matter or life? No; only purified knowledge returned;</li><li>Did it trigger a time paradox inside the Acceleration Domain? No; isolated space fully compliant throughout;</li><li>Did it benefit the majority of beings on that plane? All three schemes are for all people, not only the upper class.</li></ul><p>Self-check passed; project closed. Plane M over the next ten reality years self-selects a scheme, completes energy upgrade, joins the symbiotic network.</p><h2 id="v-comparison-with-tang-luo-s-protagonist-airdrop-reform" tabindex="-1">V. Comparison With Tang Luo&#39;s &quot;Protagonist Airdrop Reform&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-comparison-with-tang-luo-s-protagonist-airdrop-reform" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Comparison With Tang Luo&#39;s &quot;Protagonist Airdrop Reform&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the Tang Luo system, when the protagonist encounters a backward plane, the usual approach is &quot;let me teach you how to be human,&quot; directly shoving his own values and institutions over; the plane finally becomes the protagonist&#39;s vassal. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s approach is the opposite: the Acceleration Domain is only responsible for calculating the options clearly; the right to choose is returned to the plane itself. This is the joint requirement of the causal self-discipline axiom and the republican axiom of Myriad Races.</p><h2 id="vi-case-replicability-and-limitations" tabindex="-1">VI. Case Replicability and Limitations <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-case-replicability-and-limitations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Case Replicability and Limitations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This Plane M case was written as a model not because it is perfect, but because it shows the complete dual-track collaboration process. Other planes encountering similar problems may reference this process, but cannot copy the result. Every plane&#39;s ecology, culture, energy structure differs; the Acceleration Domain&#39;s deduction must take that plane&#39;s real data as input; the Quest Domain&#39;s stress test must target that plane&#39;s specific risks. Treating process as template and result as answer is itself a violation of the reality-as-base principle. The case library&#39;s meaning is teaching people how to ask questions, not answering questions for them.</p><h3 id="case-follow-up-tracking" tabindex="-1">Case Follow-Up Tracking <a class="header-anchor" href="#case-follow-up-tracking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Case Follow-Up Tracking&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Ten years after Plane M joined the symbiotic network, the Anchor Council published a follow-up tracking report: that plane selected the second scheme (law-resonance miniaturization); energy upgrade went more smoothly than expected; social stability improved; Myriad-Ranks republicanism penetration rose from 30% to 70%. The report also records an unexpected finding: Plane M during upgrade spontaneously produced a small law-resonance application, which in turn contributed back to the symbiotic network. This finding confirms dual-track design&#39;s core judgment — <strong>a civilization whose right to choose is respected does not only receive help; it also gives back to the helper.</strong></p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: 13 reality days solved a decades-long civilizational problem; efficiency up a thousand times</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: energy schemes all based on incremental development; does not require Plane M to cede resources or submit</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo-style protagonist airdrop reform turns planes into vassals; Heng Yuan Zhou-style assistance turns planes into allies</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: three schemes all for Plane M&#39;s whole people, no favoritism to any class or ethnic group</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: whole deduction process, scheme templates, causal self-check checklist all public; other planes encountering similar problems can directly reuse</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This case shows: the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s true power is not making one person strong, but letting an entire civilization, without being disturbed, find its own upgrade path. Fast is to shorten waiting; respect is to let the right to choose stay where it is. This is what civilization-grade iteration should look like.</p><p>In the final analysis, the civilizational-iteration case simulation described in this document is no isolated case — law self-consistency is backed by the law-first axiom and does not drift with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./11-推演迭代体系详解.html">11-Deduction-Iteration System Details</a> · <a href="./89-时间悖论防控机制.html">89-Time-Paradox Prevention Mechanism</a> · <a href="./75-20%激活战略实施.html">75-20%-Activation Strategy Implementation</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
